(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-20","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["我带着仍未变成定论的[[belief|判断]]走进说明会，门口募款用于山区[[surgery|外科手术]]。一位[[trader|商人]]捐出的钱足够铺半条路，展柜的[[pebble|小圆石]]取自南渠。[[poster|海报]]上[[elliptical|椭圆的]]水池亮得像镜子；前[[row|排]]坐着真正受助的人，他们不是为了任何[[irregularity|违规行为]]来鼓掌。母亲叮嘱我记住这一点。我对他们有[[sympathy|同情]]，也更怕水管出问题后，援助和责任被一阵[[violent|猛烈的]]争吵搅成同一件事，最后谁都不肯听见他们要什么。","一个修门的[[tradesman|工匠]]让我们坐近走道，外面麻雀在窗台[[perch|栖息]]，义工把热汤[[pot|锅]]搬进来。贺青先讲低[[emission|排放]]设备，手指搭在[[rubber|橡胶]]话筒套上。我没有因为他受欢迎而生[[jealousy|嫉妒]]；他的[[brief|简短]]开场确实给人希望。台下[[harmony|和谐]]也有真实缘故，基金解决了道路[[traffic|交通]]，修了危[[pier|码头]]。但当投影转到水图时，老陈用手碰了碰我的袖子：图中的泵，仍画着已被拆掉的滤筒。我们等主持开放提问，才举起手。","贺青讲起远方[[prairie|大草原]]地区的援助，我把问题拉回这里。他给孩子解释身体会[[excrete|排泄]]不需要的东西，却不能拿这句话当水质答案。我读出收据上的[[sentence|句子]]，请居民自己[[judge|判断]]日期。贺青说运输与工程没有[[connection|联系]]，图片只是[[imitate|模仿]]旧设备。我没有把原照片当成个人[[treasure|宝物]]藏着，而是请何警官同时核对[[pipeline|管道]]图和出库单。幻灯片的[[producer|制作人]]就在台下，承认图片来自今年的[[exploration|踏勘]]，而非概念图，贺青的手指缓缓离开了话筒。","制图员愿意[[share|分享]]源文件，基金工作人员却说牵涉[[law|法律]]。一位受助老人对调查仍很[[sympathetic|支持]]，说慈善[[institution|机构]]也应说实话。[[treasurer|财务主任]]走来收话筒，老陈像替船[[plough|开路]]那样给制图员让出通道。[[projector|投影仪]]亮着，日期未经[[fabrication|捏造]]，导出的图层可以按时间[[sort|排序]]。对方提到可能的[[lawsuit|诉讼]]，我觉得最[[sensible|明智的]]是让受助老人先讲完。他只问坏泵修之前，基金答应的每日两车水，还送不送。","贺青把问题写在便笺[[pad|本]]上，当众承诺供水[[truck|卡车]]继续来。他说备用[[pool|水池]]曾临时停用，照片中的孩子穿[[pyjamas|睡衣]]排队，不能等所有手续。这解释了紧急使用，却没解释为何验收没有写[[fault|故障]]。他想压住台前[[strife|争执]]，叫来[[lawyer|律师]]。我开始[[suspect|怀疑]]拆卸命令出自更早的安排，因为制图员提到负责签字的工程师叶澄：她刚拿过基金[[scholarship|奖学金]]，却要求在终稿写临时工程。那两个字最后没有上台，像南渠地址一样被悄悄拿掉。","何警官接收了源文件，供水部门确认备用车辆不会撤走。我们离场时贺青叫住我，说母亲好不容易能睡安稳，不要再钻旧港。我告诉他母亲的安稳来自事情被查清，不是别人的劝告。程雾没把这句争执做成高潮，她问叶澄现在在哪。财务主任指向地下水工程办公室，说人已调走，只留一箱草稿。赵启连夜申请查借阅记录。我把那张完美水图折进包里，下一次展开它，必须是在地下，看看纸上的水和地里的水究竟在哪里分开。"],"en":["With a tentative [[belief|belief]], I entered a briefing raising money for mountain [[surgery|surgery]]. A [[trader|trader]] donated enough for half a road. A displayed [[pebble|pebble]] came from South Channel; a [[poster|poster]] showed a shining [[elliptical|elliptical]] tank. Real beneficiaries sat in the front [[row|row]], applauding no [[irregularity|irregularity]]. Mother had urged me to remember that. My [[sympathy|sympathy]] increased my fear that [[violent|violent]] argument might obscure both aid and responsibility, drowning out their needs.","A [[tradesman|tradesman]] repairing doors seated us by the aisle. Sparrows would [[perch|perch]] outside while volunteers carried a soup [[pot|pot]]. He Qing discussed low-[[emission|emission]] equipment, touching a [[rubber|rubber]] microphone cover. His popularity provoked no [[jealousy|jealousy]]. His [[brief|brief]] opening offered hope, and the [[harmony|harmony]] had real causes: improved [[traffic|traffic]] and a repaired [[pier|pier]]. Then Chen touched my sleeve. The projected pump still contained the removed filter. We waited for questions.","He Qing discussed aid to distant [[prairie|prairie]] regions. I returned to this one. Explaining how bodies [[excrete|excrete]] unwanted things could not establish water quality. I read a receipt's [[sentence|sentence]] for residents to [[judge|judge]]. He denied a transport-engineering [[connection|connection]], claiming the picture would [[imitate|imitate]] old equipment. Rather than keep photographs as [[treasure|treasure]], I asked He to check the [[pipeline|pipeline]] plan with dispatch forms. The slide's [[producer|producer]] admitted it came from this year's [[exploration|exploration]], not a concept drawing. He Qing lowered his hand.","The drafter offered to [[share|share]] source files; staff invoked [[law|law]]. A [[sympathetic|sympathetic]] beneficiary said a charitable [[institution|institution]] should tell the truth. As the [[treasurer|treasurer]] approached, Chen helped [[plough|plough]] a path for the drafter. The [[projector|projector]] remained lit. Without [[fabrication|fabrication]], layers could [[sort|sort]] by date. A threatened [[lawsuit|lawsuit]] made it [[sensible|sensible]] to let the old man finish first. He asked whether promised water trucks would continue until repairs.","He Qing wrote on a [[pad|pad]] and promised daily [[truck|truck]] deliveries. A reserve [[pool|pool]] had closed, he said; children queueing in [[pyjamas|pyjamas]] could not await paperwork. Urgency explained temporary use, not omitted [[fault|fault]] entries. Seeking to contain [[strife|strife]], he called a [[lawyer|lawyer]]. I began to [[suspect|suspect]] an earlier arrangement. The drafter named engineer Ye Cheng, recipient of a fund [[scholarship|scholarship]], who had requested 'temporary works' on the final plan. Those words disappeared, as South Channel had from the forms.","He received the source files; the water department confirmed backup supply. Leaving, He Qing urged me not to return to the old port now that Mother could sleep. Her peace came from establishing facts, I told him. Cheng asked where Ye Cheng was rather than turn our argument into a climax. The treasurer directed us to the engineering office: Ye had been transferred, leaving drafts. Zhao applied for borrowing records. I folded the perfect water map away. Next time we opened it, we should be underground, seeing where drawn water separated from real water."]});
